+ * Bring-up only (CAMERA-PLAN.md, stages CAM3b.5/CAM4): the ultrawide
+ * capture path with the sensor on CSIS link 2, whose DC-PHY slave takes link
+ * 3's data lanes as one four-lane receiver. Enables the camera power path as
+ * camera-pwr-test does, but with the real sensor node (sony,imx386) instead
+ * of the power test nodes, the DC-PHY receiver and CSIS link 2 with WDMA
+ * context 0. Never apply it together with camera-pwr-test: both describe
+ * the device at 0x1a.
+ *
+ * Nothing binds at boot: gpio_s2mpg13, slg51002_regulator, imx386,
+ * phy_gs201_mipi_dcphy_rx and gs201_csis are blacklisted, and gs201_csis
+ * refuses to stream without allow_stream=1. Paths, not labels.
+ */
+/dts-v1/;
+/plugin/;
+
+&{/firmware/power-management/pmic-2} {
+	status = "okay";
+};
